<!doctype html><html lang="id"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Verifikasi Dokumen - PENA MAS</title><style>body{margin:0;background:#07131f;color:#edf5fb;font-family:Arial,sans-serif}.verify-wrap{min-height:100vh;display:grid;place-items:center;padding:24px}.verify-card{width:min(560px,100%);padding:30px;border:1px solid #1a5877;border-radius:20px;background:#0b2133;box-shadow:0 30px 80px #0006}.ok{width:58px;height:58px;border-radius:18px;display:grid;place-items:center;background:#173b2c;color:#79e85e;font-size:30px}.tag{display:inline-block;margin:14px 0;padding:6px 10px;border-radius:999px;background:#402e10;color:#ffc35a;font-size:12px}.meta{display:grid;gap:12px;margin-top:24px}.meta div{padding:12px 0;border-top:1px solid #234052}.meta span{display:block;color:#86a0b3;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px}.meta strong{font-size:15px}.note{margin-top:22px;color:#8ea8ba;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6}</style></head><body><main class="verify-wrap"><section class="verify-card"><div class="ok">✓</div><span class="tag">VERIFIKASI INTERNAL PROTOTYPE</span><h1>Dokumen terverifikasi di PENA MAS</h1><p>Catatan ini menunjukkan bahwa dokumen ditandatangani pada alur prototype PENA MAS.</p><div class="meta"><div><span>Nomor surat</span><strong><?= ($document['sensitivity']??'BIASA')==='BIASA' ? e($document['letter_number']) : 'Dokumen terlindungi' ?></strong></div><div><span>Penanda tangan</span><strong><?= e($document['signer_name']) ?> — <?= e($document['signer_position']) ?></strong></div><div><span>Waktu tanda tangan</span><strong><?= e(format_date_id($document['signed_at'],true)) ?></strong></div><div><span>Hash dokumen</span><strong style="word-break:break-all"><?= e($document['signature_hash']) ?></strong></div></div><p class="note">Bukan tanda tangan elektronik tersertifikasi. QR/verifikasi resmi harus diganti dengan integrasi layanan TTE resmi yang digunakan BPS.</p></section></main></body></html>